(1) Product vision for university event app 
The university campus event is a simple app created for the students and event staff it provid a single platform where students can easily watched and view there upcoming events in university and also all the upcoming seminars sports events students socity events 
By the use of this app student can register any event just one 1 click and register automatically receive reminder before activity start.
(2) Stakeholders and Their Needs
1.	University Student
Needs want a fast way to see all the events in one app sign up with one click and get notification to reminder before the event start.
2.	Event management 
Needs an easy dashboard to post event details quickly and see an up to date list of students who registered.
3.	IT Administrator
Need the app to connect securely with the university existing student login system so students don’t have to create new accounts.
4.	Facility Staff
Need to know how many students are coming so they can arrange seats safety, and equipment in advance.
5.Student Affairs Management
Wants simple report to see which event students like and attend the most.
